WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.322 --> 00:00:02.010
This is Open Sunsama

2
00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:04.110
an open source planner for your whole day

3
00:00:04.622 --> 00:00:06.343
Your tasks, your calendar

4
00:00:06.363 --> 00:00:08.824
and your AI agent all live in one place

5
00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:11.852
Start the morning on the board

6
00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:12.948
Drag a few

7
00:00:12.968 --> 00:00:15.180
tasks from your backlog into Today

8
00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.065
Each card shows how long it will take

9
00:00:18.085 --> 00:00:19.620
so you can see if your day fits

10
00:00:21.383 --> 00:00:23.312
Next, give your work a time

11
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.038
Drag a task onto the calendar

12
00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:26.803
then stretch the block to fit

13
00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:30.980
When it is time to work, open focus mode

14
00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:32.200
Start the timer

15
00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:34.345
and check off each step as you go

16
00:00:37.278 --> 00:00:38.190
Need something fast?

17
00:00:38.752 --> 00:00:39.490
Press Command K

18
00:00:39.905 --> 00:00:41.855
type a few letters, and jump right to it

19
00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:45.120
Big ideas that are not for today go

20
00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.774
on your ideas board, so your day stays clear

21
00:00:49.413 --> 00:00:52.046
Open Sunsama works with any AI agent

22
00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.150
Ask Claude to plan your afternoon

23
00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:55.847
and new tasks and time

24
00:00:55.867 --> 00:00:57.843
blocks show up in the app right away

25
00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:00.538
At the end of the day

26
00:01:00.558 --> 00:01:01.683
check off what you finished

27
00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:03.888
Open Sunsama is open source

28
00:01:04.427 --> 00:01:06.343
Try it at opensunsama.com

